  <item>
    <title>回到过去 | 陈奕迅和DUO 2010 CONCERT</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/679e48ab247d51713c322f38</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">679e48ab247d51713c322f38</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Feb 2025 16:31:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「DUO 陈奕迅2010」，一场不完美但最特别的「双面」演唱会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“好歌献给你，愿你藏心里，唯愿为你解去愁闷，快乐在歌声里”，真正的经典，永远在追问人性而非迎合潮流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期选自DUO 陈奕迅2010 演唱会专辑】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a>今天等我来</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a>好歌献给你</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a>落花流水</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>喜帖街</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">18:28</a>七百年后</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">23:02</a>约定</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1719">28:39</a>寂寞夜晚</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1847">30:47</a>浮夸</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a>禁色</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a>无人之境</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2592">43:12</a>破晓</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a>夕阳无限好</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a>人车志</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a>裙下之臣</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3814">01:03:34</a>陀飞轮</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4191">01:09:51</a>沙龙</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4467">01:14:27</a>葡萄成熟时</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4873">01:21:13</a>Medley: 热辣辣+反斗星+头发乱了+好戏在后头</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5596">01:33:16</a>芳华绝代</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5953">01:39:13</a>不来也不去</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6242">01:44:02</a>富士山下</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6546">01:49:06</a>与我常在</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6881">01:54:41</a>我的快乐时代</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7106">01:58:26</a>歌.颂</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7445">02:04:05</a>PG家长指引</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7729">02:08:49</a>那一夜有没有说</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7932">02:12:12</a>反高潮</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8144">02:15:44</a>一丝不挂</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8429">02:20:29</a>单车</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8751">02:25:51</a>等</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9007">02:30:07</a>Mr Lonely</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8753">02:25:53</a>我什么都没有</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9704">02:41:44</a>抱拥这分钟</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9927">02:45:27</a>The End of the World</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10084">02:48:04</a>我的世界未日</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10423">02:53:43</a>每一个明天</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10748">02:59:08</a>明年今日</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11167">03:06:07</a>Every Time We Say Goodbye</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【相关推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5f9ee14383c34e85dd7f68a1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5f9ee14383c34e85dd7f68a1"><span>Episode 050: 巅峰歌王路 陈奕迅</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="【深度解析「DUO陈奕迅」为何是神级现场生涯最佳！九十分钟一起沉浸探寻！】 https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HZ42147VV/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=b0bf6d5e3fef1a8544008aba4973f4a4" data-url="【深度解析「DUO陈奕迅」为何是神级现场生涯最佳！九十分钟一起沉浸探寻！】 https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HZ42147VV/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=b0bf6d5e3fef1a8544008aba4973f4a4"><span>深度解析「DUO陈奕迅」为何是神级现场生涯最佳！九十分钟一起沉浸探寻！</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>「回到过去」是「有心论radio」的一个推歌企划，在被流媒体、短视频充斥的时代，你和我或许都主动或被动地产生了碎片时间而无法真正去享受音乐，而我想通过这样一个音乐企划，让时间暂停、把灵魂放空，一起回到过去，听一听那些令人回味无穷的演出现场。</span></p><span></span><p><span>目前回到过去系列已经有这些节目：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65b6031da5fe30bcbfc834c4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65b6031da5fe30bcbfc834c4"><span>回到过去01 陶喆和SOUL POWER LIVE CONCERT</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65b6031da5fe30bcbfc834c4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65b6031da5fe30bcbfc834c4"><span>回到过去02 周杰伦和THE ONE、无与伦比、世界巡回</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66cb104e7ae3d6d8d2fcd476" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66cb104e7ae3d6d8d2fcd476"><span>回到过去03 | 方大同和WONDERLAND LIVE</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67038bf981cdab3a9337e73b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67038bf981cdab3a9337e73b"><span>回到过去04 | 王力宏和MUSIC-MAN LIVE</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/679e48ab247d51713c322f38" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/679e48ab247d51713c322f38"><span>回到过去 | 陈奕迅和DUO 2010 CONCERT</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>©节目中所有音乐作品版权均为其原版权方所有，侵删</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>「有心论radio」是一档音乐推荐播客。一个音乐自留地，不定期挖掘一些宝藏歌手、乐队和歌曲。欢迎订阅和收听。</span></p>]]></description>
