    <title>趁冷听 | 是“谁”动了我的心弦？是中国风！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6798e325247d51713cbebfbd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6798e325247d51713cbebfbd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 14:06:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“悲观者总是正确，而乐观者正在前行”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>除夕夜，祝在世界上另一别处的你，新的一年，少些匆忙，多些从容，能够拥有“山不就我，我来就山”的勇气！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025，也会多多更新，保持连接！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqmdiqufsDZoX6YnFW4UPJH8ag0R.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期「趁冷听」一共挑选了9首中国风华语歌曲，其中也包括了2010年春晚王菲献唱的「传奇」，请享用：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>陶喆-「望春风」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a>王菲-「清风徐来」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a>王力宏-「心中的日月」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a>周杰伦-「东风破」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a>周笔畅-「谁动了我的琴弦」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a>陶喆-「Susan说」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a>王力宏-「花田错」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1711">28:31</a>方大同-「红豆」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1947">32:27</a>王菲-「传奇」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【相关推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://b23.tv/fOz455g" data-url="https://b23.tv/fOz455g"><span>《和Links爬了一趟雪山，我悟了》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>©节目中所有音乐作品版权均为其原版权方所有，侵删</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>「有心论radio」是一档音乐推荐播客。一个音乐自留地，不定期挖掘一些宝藏歌手、乐队和歌曲。欢迎订阅和收听。</span></p>]]></description>
