    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2008年MUSIC-MAN LIVE的《爱错》，是难以复刻的经典之作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期精选自2008 MUSIC-MAN LIVE演唱会专辑】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>Overture</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a>摇滚怎么了！！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a>W-H-Y</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">09:02</a>花田错</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a>龙的传人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a>爱错</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a>Forever Love</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">25:41</a>安全感</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a>第一个清晨</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a>流泪手心</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a>如果你听见我的歌</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2433">40:33</a>竹林深处</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2677">44:37</a>女朋友</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2873">47:53</a>爱得得体</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3061">51:01</a>改变自己</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3367">56:07</a>落叶归根</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3695">1:01:35</a>一首简单的歌</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3948">1:05:48</a>你不在</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4253">1:10:53</a>唯一</span></li><span>  </span><li><spa